        "text": "<p>Class size: 4 max </p><p><strong>Pet Grooming Taster Day</strong></p><p>Curious about a career in dog grooming? Our Taster Day is a great way to find out what it’s really like to work in a grooming salon.</p><p>You’ll spend the day alongside our experienced groomers, seeing what goes on behind the scenes and learning how to handle, bathe and dry a dog under their supervision. We’ll introduce you to the equipment we use and give you an insight into the different skills and techniques involved in grooming.</p><p>Depending on the dogs being groomed on the day, you may see a variety of services, from a wash and fluff to different stages of a full groom. You’ll also get a feel for the day-to-day running of the salon and what<br>it takes to work as a professional dog groomer.</p><p>By the end of the day, you’ll have a better understanding of what a career in dog grooming involves, helping you decide whether it’s the right path for you.</p><p><strong>A Special Offer for Your Next Step</strong></p><p>If you enrol on our <strong>ICMG Track 1 Course within one week of completing your Taster Day</strong>, you’ll receive a <strong>£150 deduction from th cost of your course</strong>.</p><p>Ready to explore a career working with dogs? Join us for a Taster Day and take the first step towards turning your passion for pets into a rewarding career!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
